        <mxCell id="p1" value="1. PRODUCT BACKLOG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#9333EA;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="90" width="210" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1d" value="All system requirements from LGU stakeholders.
Features: Registration, QR Distribution,
GIS Heatmap, Fraud Detection, Warehouse,
Audit Logs, Reports, Recovery Tracking." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="128" y="124" width="194" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2" value="2. SPRINT PLANNING" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="90" width="210" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2d" value="Dev team selects backlog items.
Defines 2-week sprint goals.
Commits to specific deliverables." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="388" y="124" width="194" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3" value="3. SPRINT BACKLOG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="90" width="210" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3d" value="User stories broken into tasks:
Design  →  Code  →  Test  →  Deploy.
Assigned per feature module." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="648" y="124" width="194" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4" value="4. SPRINT EXECUTION
(2-Week Cycle)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#DCFCE7;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="90" width="240" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4d" value="Full-stack development cycle.
GitHub CI/CD → Vercel (web).
GitHub CI/CD → Render (backend).
EAS Build → Mobile APK testing." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="908" y="124" width="224" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5" value="5. SPRINT REVIEW" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FEE2E2;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="90" width="210" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5d" value="Working demo shown to LGU
officials and panelists.
Feedback collected and added
back to the product backlog." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1208" y="124" width="194" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6" value="6. SPRINT RETROSPECTIVE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#E0E7FF;strokeColor=#4F46E5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="360" width="210" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6d" value="Team reflects:
What went well?
What to improve?
Adjust workflow for next sprint." style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1208" y="394" width="194" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7" value="7. DAILY SCRUM
(15-min Standup)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0D1B2A;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="360" width="240" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7d" value="3 questions:
• What did I do yesterday?
• What will I do today?
• Any blockers?" style="text;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="908" y="394" width="224" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
